message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "garuda2ris: Crawl Garuda (Garba Rujukan Digital) search results into RIS"
abstract: >-
  garuda2ris is a Python library and command-line tool that crawls search
  results from Garuda (Garba Rujukan Digital), Indonesia's national index of
  scholarly publications, and exports them as RIS files for Zotero, Mendeley,
  EndNote, Rayyan and Covidence. It walks all result pages of a search,
  rewrites queries that Garuda's search box misreads, detects stale result
  pages, merges duplicate records and keeps a search log for systematic
  literature reviews.
